  m_Name: NPC_93_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: 'Morning, doctor.

    I hurt my arm when a cart knocked me over.

    I lose track halfway through a sentence and I think there are ghosts around me.

    I thought you might be able to make sense of it.'
